    construction: {"kind":"sponge","feedforward":true,"tag":"Sponge-F · pad10*1 · Dₕ","perm":"Π · 2048 bit\n16-round ARX","rateBits":"r = 1472 bit","capBits":"c = 576 bit","capName":"capacity","outFrom":"capacity","outLabel":"Digest 512 bit","outSub":"right_512(X_ℓ), no permutation call in squeeze","ffLabel":"Input capacity XORed forward into output capacity","note":"New pad10*1: j=(−|M|−2) mod r, no SHA-3 01 suffix or length field. Message bits LSB-first per byte, words and digest little-endian; last byte uses only its valid low bits. Last block XORs 0x8000000000000000 | h into A[31]; the injected capacity enters both permutation input and feed-forward; digest still right_h of final capacity.","finalTag":"D₅₁₂ → A[31]","finalTagNote":"Last block: absorb and inject Dₕ, then save capacity, permute, capacity feed-forward. Last word of Dₕ = 0x8000000000000000 | h."},
